WEBVTT

00:03.969 --> 00:10.236
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:13.636 --> 00:15.502
Who needs a bathroom
when I can shave
谁需要卫生间
当我可以刮胡子的时候

00:15.569 --> 00:19.502
and drive to work
at the same time
并开车去上班
同时

00:24.702 --> 00:28.269
- Ahh! Uhh! Ahh!
- 啊！呃！啊！

00:29.702 --> 00:33.102
Watch where you're going,
you miniscule maniac!
看你要去哪里
你这个小疯子！

00:37.802 --> 00:41.436
- Get bent, Krabs!
- 弯曲吧，蟹蟹们！

00:42.969 --> 00:45.269
Ehh.
呃。

00:47.569 --> 00:50.236
- Ohh! Ohh! Ohh!
- 哦！哦！哦！

00:50.236 --> 00:53.102
Ohh! Ah! You maniac!
哦！啊!你这个疯子！

00:53.236 --> 00:55.869
Oh, oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦，哦！

00:55.936 --> 00:57.002
Ohh!
哦！

00:57.069 --> 00:59.002
- Outta my way, you fool!
- 别挡我的路，你这个傻瓜！

01:11.436 --> 01:12.569
Hm?
嗯？

01:12.636 --> 01:15.502
Ehh! Ow!
呃！噢！

01:20.136 --> 01:22.402
Ohh, shrimp!
哦，虾！

01:28.702 --> 01:32.036
- Ohh, you--I--this--
- 哦，你--我--这个--

01:32.102 --> 01:34.102
No!
不！

01:34.236 --> 01:38.236
Traffic School!
交通学校！

01:38.236 --> 01:41.602
- Ehh, you cause a little
300 boat pile-up,
- 呃，你造成了一点
300艘船连环相撞，

01:41.669 --> 01:43.636
and they send you
to boating school.
他们送你
去划船学校。

01:43.702 --> 01:47.869
Eh, well, better make the most
of it and grab the best desk.
呃，好吧，最好充分利用
并抓住最好的桌子。

01:47.936 --> 01:49.002
Ahh.
啊。

01:49.069 --> 01:51.302
Ohh!
哦！

01:51.369 --> 01:54.236
Easy with that heinie, Eugene.
轻松点，尤金。

01:54.236 --> 01:56.236
This is my desk!
这是我的办公桌！

01:56.269 --> 01:58.802
You can have it.
你可以拥有它。

01:58.869 --> 02:00.569
I'll just take this one.
我就拿这个吧。

02:00.636 --> 02:03.302
- Ohh, you want me to take this
garbage desk
- 哦，你想让我接受这个
垃圾台

02:03.369 --> 02:05.536
so you can grab that prime seat
and get all
这样你就可以抢到最好的座位
并得到所有

02:05.602 --> 02:06.769
the teacher's attention?
老师的关注？

02:06.836 --> 02:09.602
Well, forget it.
That one's mine.
好吧，算了。
那是我的。

02:09.669 --> 02:11.102
Oh!
哦！

02:11.236 --> 02:13.236
Dibs! Ahh!
迪布斯！啊！

02:13.236 --> 02:16.036
Aha!
- This one's mine!
啊哈！
- 这个是我的！

02:16.102 --> 02:17.569
Yikes!
- Ahh! Ahh!
哎呀！
- 啊！啊！

02:17.636 --> 02:20.302
- And this one's mine.
- Ahh! Ahh!
- 这个是我的。
- 啊！啊！

02:20.369 --> 02:22.602
- This one's mine!
- No, it's mine!
- 这个是我的！
- 不，这是我的！

02:22.669 --> 02:27.002
- Mine! Mine!
- Mine! Mine!
- 矿！矿！
- 矿！矿！

02:27.069 --> 02:31.402
- Oh! My classroom! Stop!
- 哦！我的教室！停止！

02:31.469 --> 02:34.502
- Ooh, sorry, cutie.
- Suck up.
- 哦，对不起，小可爱。
- 吸吮。

02:34.569 --> 02:38.836
- Ohh, it's on.
- Ohh, bring it!
- 哦，已经开始了。
- 哦，拿来吧！

02:38.902 --> 02:42.102
- Ohh, I said knock it off.
- 哦，我说别说了。

02:42.236 --> 02:44.869
Now don't make me get rough.
现在别让我变得粗暴。

02:44.936 --> 02:47.669
Respect.
尊重。

02:47.736 --> 02:52.769
- Now just settle down and watch
this movie on driving safety.
- 现在坐下来观看
这部关于驾驶安全的电影。

02:55.836 --> 02:58.836
- Oh, yes. The freedom
of the open road.
- 哦是的。自由
的开放道路。

02:58.902 --> 03:00.936
The feeling of the wind
in your hair
风的感觉
在你的头发里

03:01.002 --> 03:03.102
and the sun on your shoulders.
和你肩上的阳光。

03:03.236 --> 03:05.802
Yes, there's nothing
like driving.
是的，什么都没有
就像开车一样。

03:05.869 --> 03:08.402
But when you don't
follow the rules,
但当你不这样做时
遵守规则，

03:08.469 --> 03:13.369
Driving can become deadly.
驾驶可能会致命。

03:13.436 --> 03:15.002
From cruising down the highway
从高速公路上行驶

03:15.069 --> 03:16.936
to parallel parking.
平行停车。

03:17.002 --> 03:18.802
- Oh, no, sorry!
- 哦，不，抱歉！

03:18.869 --> 03:21.302
Sorry! Oh, sorry.
- You don't want to be
对不起！哦，抱歉。
- 你不想成为

03:21.369 --> 03:25.702
a SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

03:25.769 --> 03:28.236
- So remember to follow
these simple rules.
- 所以记得关注
这些简单的规则。

03:28.236 --> 03:31.036
Number one, always remember
to check your mirrors.
第一，永远记住
检查你的镜子。

03:31.102 --> 03:34.769
- Uh-oh!
- 呃哦！

03:34.836 --> 03:37.936
- Yeah!
- 是的！

03:39.836 --> 03:41.102
- Oh! Ahh!
- 哦！啊！

03:41.236 --> 03:43.136
- Hey, cool camera.
Can I see?
- 嘿，很酷的相机。
我可以看吗？

03:46.802 --> 03:49.069
Ahh! Ooh! Ohh.
啊！哦！哦。

03:49.136 --> 03:51.002
- Ehh, ahh.
- 呃，啊。

03:51.069 --> 03:52.902
Whoa. Sorry I'm late.
哇哦。抱歉我来晚了。

03:52.969 --> 03:55.236
- SpongeBob, I told you before,
- 海绵宝宝，我之前告诉过你，

03:55.302 --> 03:57.802
use the door!
使用门！

03:57.869 --> 04:00.236
- Sorry, Mrs. Puff.
I was so excited for class,
- 对不起，帕芙女士。
上课的时候我很兴奋

04:00.269 --> 04:02.236
I must've forgot.
我一定是忘记了。

04:02.302 --> 04:05.302
- Just clean this place up.
- 把这个地方打扫干净就可以了。

04:05.369 --> 04:10.736
I need to call my therapist.
我需要打电话给我的治疗师。

04:10.802 --> 04:14.536
- Ooh, this is so great having
you in class with me, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，这真是太棒了
你和我一起上课，蟹老板。

04:14.602 --> 04:18.369
'Cause now, you're not only my
boss, you're also my classmate
因为现在你不仅是我的
老板，你也是我的同学

04:18.436 --> 04:23.869
and, dare I say it,
my best friend.
而且，我敢说，
我最好的朋友。

04:23.936 --> 04:27.636
Aww, make that two best friends.
哇，让这两个最好的朋友。

04:27.702 --> 04:29.236
- Get off!
- 下车！

04:29.269 --> 04:31.469
- Ohh, I think
someone is nervous
- 哦，我想
有人很紧张

04:31.536 --> 04:33.602
about being
the new kid in class.
关于存在
班上新来的孩子。

04:33.669 --> 04:36.769
No worry, I'll show you
all the ropes.
不用担心，我会告诉你
所有的绳索。

04:37.636 --> 04:40.369
Did you know that every time
you do something good,
你知道吗，每次
你做了一些好事，

04:40.436 --> 04:43.302
Mrs. Puff gives you
a star sticker?
泡芙夫人给你
星星贴纸？

04:43.369 --> 04:47.936
I'm adult.
I don't care about stickers.
我已经成年了。
我不关心贴纸。

04:48.002 --> 04:49.602
- Yeah, me neither.
- 是的，我也一样。

04:49.669 --> 04:54.502
No matter how cool
and shiny they are.
不管多酷
它们很闪亮。

04:55.669 --> 04:57.902
I'm gonna have so many stars,
我会拥有很多星星

04:57.969 --> 05:01.369
Puff will have to get
a bigger board!
泡芙一定要得到
更大的板！

05:01.436 --> 05:03.236
- Forget it, Eugene,
-算了，尤金，

05:03.269 --> 05:06.536
I am going to be
the star pupil.
我将会成为
明星瞳孔。

05:06.602 --> 05:09.336
- The prescription is
for the mega dose, right?
- 处方是
对于大剂量，对吗？

05:09.402 --> 05:11.736
- Yes, Mrs. Puff.
- Oh, thank you Doctor.
- 是的，帕芙女士。
-哦，谢谢医生。

05:11.802 --> 05:13.269
- Yeah, bye-bye.
- 是的，再见。

05:13.336 --> 05:16.036
- Now, if everyone will turn
to page 20
- 现在，如果每个人都愿意
至第 20 页

05:16.102 --> 05:17.736
in their driving manuals.
在他们的驾驶手册中。

05:20.669 --> 05:22.569
- Oh, nothing.
- 哦，没什么。

05:22.636 --> 05:25.236
I just thought you could
use a little snack.
我只是以为你可以
使用一点零食。

05:25.302 --> 05:28.736
Winkety blink.
- Why, thank you.
眨眼。
- 为什么，谢谢。

05:28.802 --> 05:32.969
You get a star.
你会得到一颗星星。

05:35.236 --> 05:36.469
Tada!
田田！

05:36.536 --> 05:38.502
- Oh, a grapefruit.
- 哦，一个葡萄柚。

05:38.569 --> 05:41.236
And a star for you.
还有一颗星星送给你。

05:44.002 --> 05:46.369
- Uh!
- 呃！

05:46.436 --> 05:50.836
All right, boys,
enough with the fruit--
好吧，孩子们，
水果就够了——

05:50.902 --> 05:53.602
- I want those stickers!
- 我想要那些贴纸！

05:53.669 --> 05:57.702
- Forget it, Krabs.
They're mine! Ah!
-算了，蟹蟹。
他们是我的！啊!

06:00.302 --> 06:03.569
- Ahh, I'm through
wasting time here.
- 啊，我结束了
在这里浪费时间。

06:03.636 --> 06:05.436
Straight from the source.
直接从源头开始。

06:06.969 --> 06:08.802
Uh, ah!
呃，啊！

06:12.102 --> 06:15.269
Oh--ahh, ahh, ahh!
啊——啊啊啊啊！

06:15.336 --> 06:17.669
- Enough!
- 足够的！

06:17.736 --> 06:21.036
- Aw, but I want more
shiny stars!
- 哦，但我想要更多
闪亮的星星！

06:21.102 --> 06:22.302
- No, I do!
- 不，我愿意！

06:23.669 --> 06:25.536
You want stars?
你想要星星吗？

06:25.602 --> 06:27.836
I'll give you stars.
我会给你星星。

06:27.902 --> 06:32.069
Ah, ah, ah, ah!
啊啊啊啊啊！

06:32.136 --> 06:36.902
Beautiful stars.
美丽的星星。

06:36.969 --> 06:39.436
- Oh, I want some.
- 哦，我想要一些。

06:39.502 --> 06:41.402
Doink! Ehh, ehh.
多因克！呃，呃。

06:41.469 --> 06:43.802
- Give me those!
Ah, ah.
- 给我那些！
啊，啊。

06:43.869 --> 06:45.669
- Ohh.
- 哦。

06:45.736 --> 06:48.469
- When driving,
it's important to be aware
- 开车时，
重要的是要意识到

06:48.536 --> 06:50.369
of everything around you.
你周围的一切。

06:50.436 --> 06:52.236
That's why we have mirrors.
这就是为什么我们有镜子。

06:52.236 --> 06:56.269
And that's why it's important
to constantly check our mirrors.
这就是为什么它很重要
不断检查我们的镜子。

06:56.336 --> 06:58.336
Like this.
像这样。

07:00.269 --> 07:02.436
- Oh, oh.
- 哦，哦。

07:02.502 --> 07:05.702
both: Eee.
两人：哎呀。

07:05.769 --> 07:07.269
- Hmm.
- 唔。

07:10.436 --> 07:13.669
both: Eee.
两人：哎呀。

07:15.302 --> 07:17.136
- Mrs. Puff,
the two new students are--
- 普芙女士，
这两名新学生是——

07:17.236 --> 07:19.236
- Nothing. Nothing's going on.
- 没有什么。什么都没有发生。

07:19.269 --> 07:22.869
- We swear.
- 我们发誓。

07:25.402 --> 07:27.102
Welcome to the test track.
欢迎来到测试赛道。

07:27.236 --> 07:31.136
Now, I want you all
to pull out slowly
现在，我想要你们所有人
慢慢地拉出来

07:31.236 --> 07:32.836
and carefully.
并仔细地。

07:32.902 --> 07:36.236
Understand?
- Slowly and carefully.
理解？
- 慢慢地、小心地。

07:36.302 --> 07:41.236
Got it.
知道了。

07:51.602 --> 07:54.869
- Now, don't--ah!
- 现在，不要——啊！

08:00.402 --> 08:02.069
Now these are my last boats
现在这些是我最后的船

08:02.136 --> 08:05.069
and if you wreck 'em,
none of you will pass my class.
如果你破坏了它们
你们谁都不会通过我的课。

08:05.136 --> 08:06.769
I can't believe I'm saying this,
我不敢相信我会这么说

08:06.836 --> 08:10.969
but be more like SpongeBob.
但更像海绵宝宝。

08:11.036 --> 08:12.902
He hasn't acted out once.
他一次也没有表现过。

08:12.969 --> 08:15.436
- Mrs. Puff, that's the nicest
thing you ever said about me.
- 泡芙女士，这是最好的
你曾经说过关于我的话。

08:15.502 --> 08:17.902
- Mm! Mm, SpongeBob,
- 毫米！嗯，海绵宝宝，

08:17.969 --> 08:21.769
the parking brake!
- Yikes! Come back, boat.
驻车制动器！
- 哎呀！回来吧，船。

08:25.502 --> 08:30.302
Yah! Oh.
啊！哦。

08:30.369 --> 08:33.169
- Hey! Ow, ow, ow, ooh, ow.
- 嘿！噢，噢，噢，噢，噢。

08:37.869 --> 08:41.436
Ehh! Ehh!
呃！呃！

08:41.502 --> 08:44.236
Ehh, ahh!
诶诶诶！

08:46.869 --> 08:48.736
Yeah!
是的！

08:48.802 --> 08:54.736
- Stop! Stop! I'm gonna lose
my teacher's license.
- 停止！停止！我会输
我的教师执照。

08:54.802 --> 08:57.002
- Can't catch me, Eugene!
- 追不到我，尤金！

08:57.069 --> 09:00.236
I'm the number one driver!
我是第一司机！

09:00.302 --> 09:02.736
- Well, good for you,
plankton.
- 嗯，对你有好处，
浮游生物。

09:02.802 --> 09:05.036
- Don't congratulate him
SpongeBob!
- 别祝贺他
海绵宝宝！

09:05.102 --> 09:07.202
- Mr. Krabs, classmates
support each other
- 螃蟹先生，同学们
互相支持

09:07.269 --> 09:08.669
and he just said
he's number one.
他只是说
他是第一。

09:08.736 --> 09:12.269
Then let's see him do this!
那我们就来看看他这样做吧！

09:12.336 --> 09:14.869
Ahh!
啊！

09:19.236 --> 09:23.002
- That's easy.
- 这很容易。

09:23.069 --> 09:25.369
- Come down from there
right now.
- 从那里下来
现在。

09:25.436 --> 09:28.069
- Never!
- 绝不！

09:28.136 --> 09:31.436
- I'm a god in this boat,
on my way to heaven!
- 我是这艘船上的神，
在我去天堂的路上！

09:31.502 --> 09:35.469
- * *
- **
- **
- **
- **
- **
- **
- **

09:35.536 --> 09:38.236
Top of the world!
世界之巅！

09:43.969 --> 09:47.269
both: Uh-oh.
两人：呃哦。

09:51.802 --> 09:54.402
That's it!
就是这样！

09:54.469 --> 09:57.669
You both fail!
你们都失败了！

09:57.736 --> 09:59.869
- Oh, come on!
Don't we at least
- 哦，来吧！
我们至少不

09:59.936 --> 10:02.502
deserve some credit
for not getting hurt?
值得一些赞扬
为了不受伤？

10:02.569 --> 10:05.069
I mean, that was
crazy dangerous.
我的意思是，那是
疯狂危险。

10:05.136 --> 10:06.402
- Yeah, it was.
- 是的，确实如此。

10:06.469 --> 10:08.802
- Hey, guys. I finished that--
- 嘿，伙计们。我说完了——

10:17.869 --> 10:20.536
- Mr. Plankton, you were in
a horrible boat accident.
-浮游生物先生，你在
一次可怕的船难

10:20.602 --> 10:22.102
It's a miracle
that you're alive.
这是一个奇迹
你还活着。

10:22.236 --> 10:24.636
However, there were
some complications.
然而，有
一些并发症。

10:24.702 --> 10:27.669
What complications?
有什么并发症？

10:27.736 --> 10:29.469
- Well, there was
some confusion
- 嗯，有
一些混乱

10:29.536 --> 10:32.702
on what body parts went where.
身体的哪些部位去了哪里。

10:35.136 --> 10:38.002
- Hey, what's all
the screaming up there?
- 嘿，怎么了
那里的尖叫声？

10:38.069 --> 10:41.736
Forget class, now we can
be together forever,
忘记上课，现在我们可以
永远在一起，

忘记上课，现在我们可以
永远在一起，